GIAR-UTN additions include, among others: the unified control layer
(legged_gym/control/, web/), the rugiar CLI and drivers, the rugiar_mcp MCP
server, the mjlab motion-tracking tasks (mjlab_tasks/), the WHRG competition
arenas, the Docker setup, and the course documentation in docs/.

